{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n '\"'^## |''^### |''^```|''^# '\"' PLAN.md\"","aggregated_output":"1:# Build plan: an original surgical action game inspired by *Trauma Center: Second Opinion*\n5:## Contents\n38:## 0. How to use this plan\n49:## 1. The game on one page\n81:## 2. Direction decisions\n102:## 3. Verified engine and Hub facts\n134:## 4. Game flow\n159:## 5. The operation\n163:### 5.1 The table\n184:### 5.2 Vitals, clock, slips\n192:### 5.3 The cursor\n204:### 5.4 The tool wheel\n208:```\n214:```\n225:### 5.5 The eight tools\n256:### 5.6 Grades, Flow, ranks\n264:### 5.7 The Steady (the gift)\n274:### 5.8 Code Blue\n278:### 5.9 Closing\n282:### 5.10 Failing and retrying\n292:### 5.11 Feel table\n316:## 6. Controls and prompts\n340:```js\n349:```\n357:## 7. Things on the table\n382:## 8. HUSH: the strains\n388:### Staccato (Case 4 on)\n391:### Legato (Case 5 on)\n398:### Tremolo (Case 6, first boss)\n405:### Da Capo (Case 8)\n408:### Fermata (Case 10)\n415:### Cantor (Case 11, final)\n425:## 9. The cases\n429:### 9.1 The Lightbox (Second Opinion)\n438:### 9.2 Chapter 1: First Incision\n459:### 9.3 Chapter 2: The Quiet Ones\n479:### 9.4 Chapter 3: Second Look\n500:### 9.5 Chapter 4: Coda\n514:### 9.6 Outside the story\n522:## 10. Story bible\n524:### World\n532:### Cast\n547:### How it sounds\n577:### Beats\n603:## 11. The ward\n616:## 12. Multiplayer: Grand Rounds\n620:### 12.1 The case\n635:### 12.2 On its own\n639:### 12.3 In a Hub session\n654:### 12.4 The network shape\n670:## 13. Attract mode\n690:## 14. Dev mode\n705:## 15. UI and the 10-foot rules\n720:### About/Credits\n730:```json\n765:```\n776:## 16. Art direction\n782:### Operative field\n798:### Portraits\n802:### Instruments and icons\n806:### Stages\n810:### Ward and cinematics\n814:### Title\n818:### Lightbox\n824:## 17. Animation\n849:## 18. Audio\n853:### Sound effects\n857:### Voices\n877:### The choir\n881:### Music\n902:## 19. Code architecture\n904:### 19.1 Layout (relative to the dev folder)\n906:```\n927:```\n931:### 19.2 The sim is plain data\n939:```js\n943:```\n947:### 19.3 Content is data\n951:### 19.4 One bot, three jobs\n954:```js\n956:```\n959:### 19.5 Engine use\n965:```js\n974:```\n978:## 20. Testing\n1019:## 21. Build order\n1040:## 22. Done checklist (TASK.md, line by line)\n1090:## Appendix A: tissue painter\n1098:```js\n1144:```\n1146:## Appendix B: a site recipe\n1150:```js\n1165:```\n1167:## Appendix C: portrait painter\n1171:```js\n1234:```\n1236:## Appendix D: Hub skeleton, page head and harness runner\n1240:```html\n1249:```\n1253:```js\n1293:```\n1297:```python\n1319:```\n1321:## Appendix E: gamepad stub and touch-notice patch\n1325:```js\n1330:```\n1334:```js\n1337:```\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
