{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"agent_message","text":"The case data and core project are in place. I’m implementing the tool gestures next: controlled extraction, traced cuts, cross-and-release stitches, painting, timed injections, and heat management. The simulation will stay separate from drawing so retries, rewind, co-op, and automated playthroughs use the same rules.\n"}}
