{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('Trauma-Sector-Second-Signal-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-011709/src/sim/bot.js');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"&&\"'!(o.type==='\"'fermata'&&o.stage<2&&\"'!Op.eyeOpen(S,o))\",'\"'').replace(\\\"||o.type==='fermata'&&o.stage<2&&\"'!Op.eyeOpen(S,o)\",'\"'').replace(\\\"goal=[o.x+o.axis[0]*(o.depth+4),o.y+o.axis[1]*(o.depth+4)];extra.trigger=1;\\\", \\\"const remaining=Math.max(3,o.depth-p.grab.pull+3);goal=[B.cursor.x+o.axis[0]*remaining,B.cursor.y+o.axis[1]*remaining];extra.trigger=1;\\\").replace(\\\"extra.trigger=\"'!swap&&G.dist(B.cursor,o)<5&&p.heat<.88&&p.lock<=0?1:0;\", \"extra.trigger=!swap&&G.dist(B.cursor,o)<5&&p.heat<.88&&p.lock<=0&&!(o.type==='\"'fermata'&&o.stage<2&&\"'!Op.eyeOpen(S,o))?1:0;\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('\"'Trauma-Sector-Second-Signal-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-011709/notes/feedback.md');s=p.read_text().replace('None yet.','1. Full-case bot found extraction could stall after a tear reduced progress. Fixed bot to pull the remaining depth; human players can already keep pulling. Not a game blocker.\\\\n2. Fermata bot approached only during the short eye opening and missed it repeatedly. Fixed anticipatory positioning and sonar. Not a player game blocker.')\np.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
